// The parity law run for five generations: one origin, nine rings.
name Lattice
rule B1357/S1357
steps 5
hint One origin, five generations of echo. The pattern repeats itself at every scale.
tip Nine rings in a three-by-three lattice: the origin is the centre of the central ring.
